0160 | \begin{theorem} \label{thm:rand}
0161 | There is a randomized $\tilde{O}(n + t)$ time, $\tilde{O}(n^2+n \log ^2 t)$ space algorithm for \textsc{SubsetSum}.
0162 | \end{theorem}
0163 | 
0164 | The algorithm in Theorem~\ref{thm:rand} is Monte Carlo with one-sided error, in that it returns YES on a valid instance with probability $1-\frac{1}{\Omega(n+t)}$, and always returns NO on an invalid instance.
